# 14. Create a Simple Detection

Use:

```bash
grep "Failed password" security-events.log | awk '{print $(NF-3)}' | sort | uniq -c
```

If the count is greater than or equal to 5:

```text
Potential SSH brute-force activity detected.
```

Detection logic:

```text
IF
failed SSH attempts >= 5

AND

same source IP

THEN

generate investigation alert.
```

