# 19. Important SIEM Concepts

| Concept        | Meaning                                         |
| -------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |
| Log            | Recorded activity                               |
| Event          | Individual security occurrence                  |
| Alert          | Detection requiring investigation               |
| SIEM           | Centralized security monitoring platform        |
| Parsing        | Extracting useful fields from logs              |
| Normalization  | Converting different formats into common fields |
| Correlation    | Connecting related events                       |
| Detection Rule | Logic used to identify suspicious activity      |
| IOC            | Indicator associated with potential compromise  |
| Incident       | Confirmed security event requiring response     |

